<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Das Beer Boot</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Vat19.com</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Das Beer Boot</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2zbcmGv3eivw1Tru9SWc8w</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">7 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Das Beer Boot Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Das isn’t boring.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I drink ze beer from ze glass, but that's boring</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Das Boot, ooh ja, that's more like it, keep pouring</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I have ze German accent and so of course I love beer</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But how much can the boot hold?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Eins, zwei, drei</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Eins, zwei, drei, vier</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Hook]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Da, da, Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Da, da, Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I have ze beer and so I need ze light snack</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A giant pretzel? Totally perfect, cheese goes nicely with that</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm all dirty and tired, and probably needs a shower</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Energy drink should do, I just need more than five hours</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Hook]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Da, da, Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Da, da, Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So very totally cool</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 3]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wake up early and I hunger for breakfast</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Buttermilk pancakes, sausage, eggs, bacon, sugar and cinnamon</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And for lunch I want ze wiener schnitzel, ooh ja</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gotta have surf with my turf</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And wash it down with some butter</p><p ttm:agent="v1">For dinner it's simple, I always eat ze same thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sauerbraten, goulash, bratwurst, spätzle</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hasenpfeffer and mayo</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And to top it all off, I zink ze cake looks amazing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There's just one thing I'd change, I zink it goes without saying[Hook]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Da, da, Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Da, da, Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Stick it in the boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Da, da, Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Da, da, Das Boot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh-oh</p></div></body></tt>